egories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","review_id":"hrcTLlpCMHK4yD_E-KAPxg","date":"2012-12-24T21:34:38","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9546689391136169,"text_excerpt":"A great dive bar. In the French Quarter but removed from Bourbon Street, this place is ultra laid-back. It's dark and comfortable in there, with couch-style booths lining the wall facing the \"action\". The bartender and all of the patrons are easy-going and like similar-minded people; I was given money for the jukebox and a round of whiskey for playing Stevie Ray Vaughn's \"Tin Pan Alley\". The jukebox, by the way, is an awesome collection of jazz, blues, soul and some good classic rock. Just remember to keep it low and slow. Prices on whiskey was fantastic and everyone was having a nice, chill time. I love this bar."},{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","review_id":"dGqwOmjrdmTTIyGWf-cLEQ","date":"2011-01-08T11:54:34","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9428004026412964,"text_excerpt":"I love the Chart Room. This is the perfect dive/place to chill for a couple hours over cheap drinks or pick up a cheap stiff drink to help you maneuver through the tourists of the French Quarter. The bartenders are not the friendliest bunch but they are a trip (Will). Please don't walk in here and ask for a Hurricane or some other foo-foo drink. This is the place you pick up a solid mixed drink (my personal favorite is a 28; a 7&7 X 2). Most of your glass will be booze and they'll add a little floater of mixer on top to make you feel like less of a lush. This is a great perch for game or people watching. Only downside is that it's cash only."},{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","review_id":"ozuTZUB_ef6tP7AqUtXkTw","date":"2015-05-21T22:32:53","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9267314076423645,"text_excerpt":"This might just be the King of all dive bars. The drinks are cheap and the bar stays open really late which is cool. the people in the bar are all interesting characters. I'm not really a \"dive bar\" kind of girl, but I really liked this place for some reason. The bartender was really cool and it was pretty slow when we got there so he gave us about a million restaurant and bar recommendations. He was really personable and that made us feel like we were talking to a friend. Its a cash only bar, and luckily we had cash with us. This is a really nice spot to relax and be an anti-tourist for a moment."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","photo_id":"yVuRQFw4HSZrkIS2MsIbaA","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/yVuRQFw4HSZrkIS2MsIbaA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9577890038490295},{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","photo_id":"7K_hWa5e87PRBX28fExdbQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7K_hWa5e87PRBX28fExdbQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.917712926864624},{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","photo_id":"nFExqw9g-Q49ypcdnfNUQg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/nFExqw9g-Q49ypcdnfNUQg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8429209589958191},{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","photo_id":"h9SgkAMEAkkw55__N1jiYQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/h9SgkAMEAkkw55__N1jiYQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8395876884460449},{"business_id":"ZMRfHHbyTQb_Yje9GhrVfw","photo_id":"0V0aZm-fMjJiDijX1UqP3Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/0V0aZm-fMjJiDijX1UqP3Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7413116693496704}]},"notebook_case":null}
